ts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.160" end="3:58.480">ば</span></span></span><span begin="3:58.480" end="3:58.683">よ</span><span begin="3:58.683" end="3:58.780">り</span><span begin="3:58.780" end="3:58.960">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.960" end="3:59.623">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.623" end="4:00.253">き</span></span></span><span begin="4:00.253" end="4:02.160">に</span> <span begin="4:02.160" end="4:02.523">だ</span><span begin="4:02.523" end="4:02.833">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:02.833" end="4:03.323">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.323" end="4:03.593">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.593" end="4:03.760">だ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">零</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:03.923" end="4:04.260">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:04.260" end="4:04.420">ぼ</span></span></span><span begin="4:04.420" end="4:04.660">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">落</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:04.660" end="4:04.880">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:04.880" end="4:05.180">ち</span><span begin="4:05.180" end="4:06.780">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">先于言语 唯有泪水悄然滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kotoba yori mo saki ni data namida koboreochita</span></p><p begin="4:07.560" end="4:10.080" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:07.560" end="4:07.760">さ</span><span begin="4:07.760" end="4:07.960">あ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">物</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.960" end="4:08.140">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.140" end="4:08.280">の</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">語</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.280" end="4:08.440">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.440" end="4:08.600">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:08.600" end="4:08.760">り</span></span></span><span begin="4:08.760" end="4:08.920">は</span><span begin="4:08.920" end="4:09.080">も</span><span begin="4:09.080" end="4:09.240">う</span><span begin="4:09.240" end="4:09.500">お</span><span begin="4:09.500" end="4:09.720">し</span><span begin="4:09.720" end="4:09.860">ま</span><span begin="4:09.860" end="4:10.080">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">来吧 故事已到此落幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sā monogatari wa mō oshimai</span></p><p begin="4:10.140" end="4:12.540" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.140" end="4:10.380">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:10.380" end="4:10.520">づ</span></span></span><span begin="4:10.520" end="4:10.840">き</span><span begin="4:10.840" end="4:11.000">は</span><span begin="4:11.000" end="4:11.300">こ</span><span begin="4:11.300" end="4:11.480">れ</span><span begin="4:11.480" end="4:11.800">か</span><span begin="4:11.800" end="4:12.540">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">续篇将从此刻开启</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsuzuki wa korekara</span></p><p begin="4:12.740" end="4:15.320" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.740" end="4:12.940">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">話</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.940" end="4:13.080">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:13.080" end="4:13.400">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:13.400" end="4:13.600">し</span></span></span><span begin="4:13.600" end="4:13.880">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">進</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:13.880" end="4:14.030">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:14.030" end="4:14.240">す</span></span></span><span begin="4:14.240" end="4:14.700">ん</span><span begin="4:14.700" end="4:14.860">だ</span><span begin="4:14.860" end="4:15.320">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">等故事继续向前推进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ohanashi ga susundara</span></p><p begin="4:15.320" end="4:17.980" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:15.320" end="4:15.640">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:15.640" end="4:16.280">し</span></span></span><span begin="4:16.280" end="4:16.900">え</span><span begin="4:16.900" end="4:17.100">て</span><span begin="4:17.100" end="4:17.240">あ</span><span begin="4:17.240" end="4:17.420">げ</span><span begin="4:17.420" end="4:17.980">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我再讲给你听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">oshiete ageru</span></p><p begin="4:18.200" end="4:22.600" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.200" end="4:18.560">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.560" end="4:18.700">め</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:18.700" end="4:19.020">み</span></span></span><span begin="4:19.020" end="4:19.160">が</span><span begin="4:19.160" end="4:19.320">ち</span><span begin="4:19.320" end="4:19.500">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.500" end="4:20.163">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:20.163" end="4:20.760">ま</span></span></span><span begin="4:20.760" end="4:22.600">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将耽于梦幻的当下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yumemigachi na ima o</span></p><p begin="4:22.713" end="4:25.760" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:22.713" end="4:23.020">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.020" end="4:23.320">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.320" end="4:23.640">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:23.640" end="4:23.840">つ</span></span></span><span begin="4:23.840" end="4:24.440">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.440" end="4:24.780">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">舞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:24.780" end="4:24.980">ま</span></span></span><span begin="4:24.980" end="4:25.260">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">込</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.260" end="4:25.460">こ</span></span></span><span begin="4:25.460" end="4:25.760">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">珍重地收进心底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">taisetsu ni shimaikomu</span></p><p begin="4:25.820" end="4:28.360" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:25.820" end="4:26.240">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.240" end="4:26.400">め</span></span></span><span begin="4:26.400" end="4:26.860">じゃ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:26.980" end="4:27.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:27.340" end="4:27.500">く</span><span begin="4:27.500" end="4:27.720">な</span><span begin="4:27.720" end="4:27.820">る</span><span begin="4:27.820" end="4:28.000">ま</span><span begin="4:28.000" end="4:28.360">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">直到它不再只是梦境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yume ja naku naru made</span></p><p begin="4:28.500" end="4:30.480" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:28.500" end="4:28.800">二</span><span begin="4:28.800" end="4:28.960">人</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">占</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:28.960" end="4:29.300">じ</span></span></span><span begin="4:29.300" end="4:29.420">め</span><span begin="4:29.420" end="4:29.620">し</span><span begin="4:29.620" end="4:30.480">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">两人独享那</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futarijime shita</span></p><p begin="4:30.680" end="4:36.080" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">満</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.680" end="4:30.900">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:30.900" end="4:31.053">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">天</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:31.053" end="4:31.270">て</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:31.270" end="4:31.400">ん</span></span></span><span begin="4:31.400" end="4:31.540">の</span><span begin="4:31.540" end="4:31.880">そ</span><span begin="4:31.880" end="4:32.180">ら</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">輝</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.180" end="4:32.500">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.500" end="4:32.680">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.680" end="4:32.820">や</span></span></span><span begin="4:32.820" end="4:32.980">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">魔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:32.980" end="4:33.300">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:33.300" end="4:33.660">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:33.660" end="4:36.080">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">满天夜空里 闪耀的魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">manten no sora kagayaku mahō</span></p></div></body></tt>